{"text": "Featherstonehaugh Tax & Advisory, Inc.\n2150 South 1300 East, Suite 500, Salt Lake City, Utah 84106\nTel. 801.555.0131    Fax 801.555.0132    www.featherstonehaugh-tax.example\nJanuary 12, 2026\nTevita Fonoti and Mele Fonoti-Greer\n874 West Pacific Avenue\nTaylorsville, UT 84123\nRe: 2025 individual income tax return -- client file FTA-11872\nDear Mr. Fonoti and Ms. Fonoti-Greer:\nThank you for choosing us again. This letter confirms what we will and will not do for you this year. Please read it, sign the last page, and return it with your organizer.\nWhat we will do\nWe will prepare your 2025 federal Form 1040 and your Utah resident return from the information you give us, including Schedule C for Fonoti Landscape & Stone, LLC (EIN 87-3340918). We will not audit or verify your records. We may ask you to explain items that look incomplete or inconsistent.\nYou told us that Mele's son from her first marriage, Sione (born August 3, 2011), lived with you all year and that his father has agreed in writing not to claim him. Please send us the signed Form 8332. Without it we cannot claim the child tax credit for him.\nYour responsibilities\nYou are responsible for the completeness and accuracy of what you give us, and for keeping the records that support it. The return is yours; review it before you sign Form 8879. Returns are due April 15. If we do not have all of your documents by March 13, 2026 we will file an extension, which extends the time to file but not the time to pay.\nIdentity and bank details we have on file\nSo that you can check them, here is what we carried forward from last year. Tell us at once if anything is wrong.\nItem\tTevita\tMele\nSSN / ITIN\tXXX-XX-7907\t9XX-7X-4410\nDate of birth\t02/19/1980\t11/30/1983\nOccupation\tLandscape contractor\tDental hygienist\nMobile\t801-555-0175\t801-555-0199\n\nRefund or payment account: Wasatch Peaks Credit Union, routing 034481750, checking 0091 7745 30. Identity Protection PIN issued to Tevita by the IRS for this season: 604417.\nMele has told us that her ITIN is being replaced by a Social Security number now that her adjustment of status was approved. Bring the new card when you have it; we will need to notify the IRS so that her earlier returns are linked.\nFees\nOur fee for the returns described above is $1,150, plus $225 if we prepare the city business license renewal. Last year's balance of $310.00 remains unpaid and is due before we begin. Work outside this letter, such as answering a notice, is billed at $190 an hour.\nPrivacy\nUnder 26 U.S.C. § 7216 and Circular 230 we may not disclose your tax return information to anyone outside this firm, or use it for anything other than preparing your return, without your written consent. We use an encrypted portal, not e-mail, for documents: https://portal.featherstonehaugh-tax.example/fonoti\nIf this letter matches your understanding, please sign below.\nSincerely,\nCordelia Featherstonehaugh, EA\nEnrolled agent no. 00118264-EA\ncordelia@featherstonehaugh-tax.example\nAccepted: ______________________ (T. Fonoti)     ______________________ (M. Fonoti-Greer)     Date: __________", "kind": "Rich Text document", "detail": "503 words", "notes": [], "names": {"people": ["Tevita Fonoti", "Mele Fonoti-Greer", "Sione", "Tevita", "Mele", "Cordelia Featherstonehaugh", "M. Fonoti-Greer"], "companies": ["Featherstonehaugh Tax & Advisory, Inc.", "Fonoti Landscape & Stone, LLC", "Wasatch Peaks Credit Union", "IRS", "featherstonehaugh-tax", "featherstonehaugh-tax.example"]}, "topics": {"places": ["Salt Lake City", "Taylorsville", "UT", "Wasatch Peaks Credit Union"], "health": [], "sensitive": ["SSN", "ITIN", "Date of birth", "Occupation", "Mobile", "child tax credit", "adjustment of status", "Social Security number"], "names": ["Tevita", "Mele", "Sione", "Cordelia", "Fonoti", "Fonoti-Greer"]}, "judged": {"candidates": 0, "requests": 0, "failures": 0, "places": [], "labels": {}}, "chunks": 2, "chunkErrors": 0, "topicErrors": 0, "im